; BGM変更：Guil-me N'o sinruits-Vocal無-
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge2-13-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:では私に<br>聞きたい事とは<br>なんですか？|#0102Trial13_Warden001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; アイテム表示・ナノカの鍵

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL9,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……なら、<br>鍵について<br>聞いてもいいかしら。|#0102Trial13_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【懲罰房の鍵】……<br>あれは普段、<br>鍵がかかっているの？|#0102Trial13_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:もちろんですとも。|#0102Trial13_Warden002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ミリアさんの<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_01\">身体の拘束</link>に加え、<br>扉の鍵は<br>かけるようにしています。<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_02\">事件当時</link>も<br>かかっていたはずですよ。|#0102Trial13_Warden003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……いや、じゃあナノカが<br>鍵持ってるわけねーじゃん。<br>間違いなく<br>開いてたんだっつーの。|#0102Trial13_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんなこと<br>私に言われましても……。|#0102Trial13_Warden004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; アイテム表示：小さな鍵

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:鍵といえば……<br>部屋の中から、<br>もう１つ鍵が<br>見つかっているんです。|#0102Trial13_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:この鍵って、<br>なんの鍵なんですかね？|#0102Trial13_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それは……<br>おそらく牢屋敷内にある<br>キャビネットの鍵ですね。|#0102Trial13_Warden005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"どこの部屋にある<br>戸棚の鍵でしたっけ……<br>私たちでは<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_03\">管理していない物</link>ですね。<br>なんにせよ、<br>懲罰房には<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_04\">関係ありません</link>よ。|#0102Trial13_Warden006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open04
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:なんでお前が<br>わかんないんだよ……！|#0102Trial13_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私たちも管理する事が<br>いろいろありまして。<br>全てを管理できている<br>わけでは<br>ないんです。|#0102Trial13_Warden007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR1,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ってかさ。<br>管理って言ったら<br>あの拷問ショーの紙って<br>なんだったん？|#0102Trial13_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:懲罰房を開ける予定が<br>なかったとか<br>言ってたけどさぁ……。<br>あれって誰が<br>書いたんだよ。|#0102Trial13_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"さあ？<br>少なくとも<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_05\">私達ではありません</link>よ。<br>今日は<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_06\">鍵を開ける予定</link>は<br>ありませんでした。<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_07\">指示もしておりません</link>。|#0102Trial13_Warden008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; アイテム表示・ミリアのスマホ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:なら……<br>スマホについては<br>何か知っている事は<br>ないかしら？|#0102Trial13_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ライトやアラームに<br>配信機能……<br>いろいろ機能が<br>あるけれど、<br>他に何か特別な機能は<br>ないのかしら？|#0102Trial13_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR1,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ミリアちゃんを殺すのに<br>役立ちそうな何かが……ね。|#0102Trial13_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そうですねぇ……。<br>皆さんに配られたスマホは<br>外部にこそ繋がりませんが、<br>いろいろな事ができます。|#0102Trial13_Warden009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:スマホ固有のＩＤがわかれば、<br>メッセージや通話も<br>できますし……。|#0102Trial13_Warden010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:配信や録音といった<br>いろいろなアプリが入ってますよ。<br>頑丈で、<br>よほどのことがないと壊れない<br>高性能機です。|#0102Trial13_Warden011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:その分容量が多くて<br>初期化には時間が<br>かかりますけどね。<br>それでも皆さんに配る時には、<br>ちゃんと出荷状態に戻して<br>配っていますよ。|#0102Trial13_Warden012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"なので誰かのスマホにのみ<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_08\">特別な機能</link>がついている……<br>なんてことはありませんので<br>ご安心を。<br>それとも何か<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_09\">不具合</link>でも？|#0102Trial13_Warden013|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そう、<br>それは良かったわ。<br>催眠をかけるアプリでも<br>入ってたら<br>大変だものね？|#0102Trial13_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR13,ArmL10,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Comical_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:んなもん<br>あるわけねーだろ！|#0102Trial13_Coco004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

